EXT. ABERNETHY GREEN - REENACTMENT CAMPGROUND - DAY

A muddy field of canvas tents. Smoke from a cookfire. Thaddeus Pell, 40s, in a full 1776 militia coat and tricorn, sits on a barrel holding a laptop wrapped in a burlap sack. He is very aware of the modern world and very hopeful nobody sees it.

Philippa Voight, 30s, in a plain linen gown and apron, walks up carrying a wooden bucket. She stops. Squints.

PHILIPPA
Are you ColonelHuzzah88?

THADDEUS
Are you Mistress_Quill?

PHILIPPA
Yes, hi. Thaddeus. Hi.

THADDEUS
Philippa! In the flesh! Well, in the flax.

She sets down the bucket. They shake hands, awkwardly, formally, as period requires.

ON LAPTOP SCREEN: a Slack channel titled #the-1776-crew. The newest message reads:

ON SCREEN: wick_the_unbothered: are u 2 there yet or what

THADDEUS (CONT'D)
Wick's online. They said they'd join by video, they couldn't get off work.

Thaddeus unwraps the burlap and turns the laptop so both can see. A video window opens: a cluttered cubicle, a lanyard, a fluorescent light. WICK, 20s, wears a headset and a cheap tricorn made of black construction paper.

WICK (V.O.)
(through laptop speakers)
Oh my god, you're real. Hi! Is that the real mud?

PHILIPPA
It's the real mud.

WICK (V.O.)
I'm so sorry I'm not there, my manager is literally behind me, they keep walking past. One sec.

Wick quickly minimizes a spreadsheet and sits very straight.

THADDEUS
(to Wick)
You look very serious.

WICK (V.O.)
I'm in a meeting. Technically. I'm muted, I think? Am I muted?

PHILIPPA
No.

WICK (V.O.)
Oh no. (muttering) Okay. Okay. It's fine.

Philippa sits on the grass, tucks her skirts. Thaddeus offers her a hard biscuit from a leather pouch.

PHILIPPA
Is it period?

THADDEUS
It's from Costco. But I dipped it in tea so it looks old.

PHILIPPA
That's the most you thing I've ever heard and I've known you for two years in text.

WICK (V.O.)
Aw, you guys are cute. This is cute. I'm gonna cry at my desk.

THADDEUS
Please don't cry at your desk, Wick.

WICK (V.O.)
I use they/them, Thaddeus, not "cry at your desk," come on.

A beat. Then all three laugh. A distant musket goes off POP over the tents. Philippa bites the biscuit and winces.

PHILIPPA
Okay. That's definitely Costco.
